1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
Diwali ke agle din Delhi ka AQI badh kyun

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:03,810
jaata hai?

3
00:00:03,830 --> 00:00:07,580
Aaj subah 7 baje Delhi ka AQI 368 tha.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,110
Patakhe toh raat ko hi band ho gaye.

5
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:10,270
Toh science kya kehti hai?

6
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:11,360
Pehle chemistry.

7
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,260
Patakhe mein potassium nitrate,

8
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:15,140
sulfur aur charcoal hota hai,

9
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,780
aur rang ke liye strontium,

10
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,750
barium aur copper jaise metals.

11
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:22,580
Jalne pe yeh PM2.5 ke bahut chhote kan aur

12
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,795
sulfur dioxide jaisi gases chhodte hain.

13
00:00:24,815 --> 00:00:25,700
Ab physics.

14
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:28,210
Normally zameen ke paas hawa garam hoti

15
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:29,520
hai, woh upar uthti hai,

16
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,290
aur dhuaan saath le jaati hai.

17
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:33,410
Par sardi ki raat mein zameen jaldi thandi

18
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:34,290
ho jaati hai.

19
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:35,330
Neeche thandi hawa,

20
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:36,370
upar garam hawa.

21
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,580
Ise temperature inversion kehte hain.

22
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,940
Thandi, bhaari hawa upar nahi uth paati,

23
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:43,010
toh dhuaan bhi neeche hi ruka rehta hai.

24
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:44,320
Science mein ek shabd hai,

25
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:46,607
mixing height, yaani zameen se kitni

26
00:00:46,627 --> 00:00:48,590
oonchai tak hawa ghul-mil sakti hai.

27
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:50,520
Din mein yeh oonchai zyada hoti hai,

28
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:51,500
raat mein bahut kam.

29
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:54,120
Upar se sardi mein hawa bhi dheemi chalti

30
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:54,450
hai.

31
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:56,360
Toh wahi dhuaan ek chhoti si jagah mein

32
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,540
bhar jaata hai, aur concentration bahut

33
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,430
badh jaata hai.

34
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:01,440
Aur raat bhar ek aur cheez hoti hai.

35
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:03,880
Patakhon ki gases, hawa ki nami ke saath

36
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:06,240
react karke naye chhote kan bana leti

37
00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:06,630
hain.

38
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:08,625
Inhe secondary particles kehte hain.

39
00:01:08,690 --> 00:01:12,000
Matlab subah tak PM2.5 aur bhi badh sakta

40
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:12,330
hai.

41
00:01:12,350 --> 00:01:13,490
Aur aakhri baat.

42
00:01:13,510 --> 00:01:15,510
Subah jo AQI aap dekhte ho,

43
00:01:15,530 --> 00:01:17,070
woh sirf us pal ki hawa nahi hai.

44
00:01:17,090 --> 00:01:20,630
CPCB ka AQI pichle 24 ghante ka average

45
00:01:20,650 --> 00:01:21,340
hota hai.

46
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:22,705
Matlab aaj subah ka number,

47
00:01:22,725 --> 00:01:24,990
kal raat ke patakhon ko bhi gin raha hai.

48
00:01:25,010 --> 00:01:26,500
Toh patakhon ki chemistry,

49
00:01:26,550 --> 00:01:27,680
temperature inversion,

50
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,910
kam mixing height, raat bhar bante naye

51
00:01:29,930 --> 00:01:32,160
kan, aur 24 ghante ka average.

52
00:01:32,230 --> 00:01:35,350
Isliye Diwali ke agle din AQI sabse zyada

53
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:36,060
dikhta hai.

54
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:38,240
Filhal khidkiyaan band rakho aur bahar

55
00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:39,120
mask pehno.

56
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:41,500
Aur aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained

57
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,730
ko subscribe karo!
